  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPEF Fund for Technical Assistance and Economic Cooperation (IFTAEC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFTAEC supports ODA-eligible Indo-Pacific Economic Framework (IPEF) countries (Fiji, India, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines, Thailand, and Vietnam) with technical assistance and capacity building projects. IFTAEC funds these projects consistent with IPEF&#x2019;s four key themes on trade, supply chain resilience, tax and anti-corruption, and the net zero transition. IFTAEC projects are demand-driven, promote economic growth and leverage Australian expertise and partnerships. Projects embed gender equality, disability and social inclusion, and climate change principles.</narrative>
  </description>
